te differs from the less rigid, less durable asphaltic concrete, which has a bituminous binder."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Bloczek_betonowy.jpg/330px-Bloczek_betonowy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Concrete","wikidata":"Q22657"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg/500px-Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg/1280px-Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg/500px-Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Storm clouds over the city of Yekaterinburg, Russia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Overcast_Mehamn.jpg/500px-Overcast_Mehamn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Overcast_Mehamn.jpg/1280px-Overcast_Mehamn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Overcast_Mehamn.jpg/500px-Overcast_Mehamn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A completely overcast sky in Mehamn, Norway.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOvercast_Mehamn.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Bloczek_betonowy.jpg/500px-Bloczek_betonowy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 